  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This particular variant of the Ugandan Knuckles meme is floating on a jetpack and it is very difficult to tell where the character model starts and ends.\n\nWhile stationary, I tried to hit him over the course of two whole clips, but could not kill him once in the entire round of CTF.\n\nI have no issues with my aiming when it comes to normal sized characters or even small chibi anime girls.\n\nIt feels like they didn't rig the character so it doesn't have a skeleton and therefore collision is not working as intended.",
